{"id":96,"name":"العلق","transliteration":"Al-'Alaq","translation_fr":"L'adhérence","translation_en":"The Clot","type":"meccan","total_verses":19,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"ٱقۡرَأۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ","translation_fr":"Lis, au nom de ton Seigneur qui a créé","translation_en":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created","transliteration":"Iqra biismi rabbika allathee khalaqa"},{"id":2,"text":"خَلَقَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مِنۡ عَلَقٍ","translation_fr":"qui a créé l'homme d'une adhérence","translation_en":"Created man from a clinging substance","transliteration":"Khalaqa alinsana min AAalaqin"},{"id":3,"text":"ٱقۡرَأۡ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلۡأَكۡرَمُ","translation_fr":"Lis! Ton Seigneur est le Très Noble","translation_en":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous","transliteration":"Iqra warabbuka alakramu"},{"id":4,"text":"ٱلَّذِي عَلَّمَ بِٱلۡقَلَمِ","translation_fr":"qui a enseigné par la plume [le calame]","translation_en":"Who taught by the pen","transliteration":"Allathee AAallama bialqalami"},{"id":5,"text":"عَلَّمَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمۡ يَعۡلَمۡ","translation_fr":"a enseigné à l'homme ce qu'il ne savait pas","translation_en":"Taught man that which he knew not","transliteration":"AAallama alinsana ma lam yaAAlam"},{"id":6,"text":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطۡغَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Prenez-garde! Vraiment l'homme devient rebelle","translation_en":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses","transliteration":"Kalla inna alinsana layatgha"},{"id":7,"text":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"dès qu'il estime qu'il peut se suffire à lui-même (à cause de sa richesse)","translation_en":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient","transliteration":"An raahu istaghna"},{"id":8,"text":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجۡعَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Mais, c'est vers ton Seigneur qu'est le retour","translation_en":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return","transliteration":"Inna ila rabbika alrrujAAa"},{"id":9,"text":"أَرَءَيۡتَ ٱلَّذِي يَنۡهَىٰ","translation_fr":"As-tu vu celui qui interdit","translation_en":"Have you seen the one who forbids","transliteration":"Araayta allathee yanha"},{"id":10,"text":"عَبۡدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","translation_fr":"à un serviteur d'Allah [Muhammad] de célébrer la Salât","translation_en":"A servant when he prays","transliteration":"AAabdan itha salla"},{"id":11,"text":"أَرَءَيۡتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلۡهُدَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Vois-tu s'il est sur la bonne voie","translation_en":"Have you seen if he is upon guidance","transliteration":"Araayta in kana AAala alhuda"},{"id":12,"text":"أَوۡ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقۡوَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"ou s'il ordonne la piété","translation_en":"Or enjoins righteousness","transliteration":"Aw amara bialttaqwa"},{"id":13,"text":"أَرَءَيۡتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Vois-tu s'il dément et tourne le dos","translation_en":"Have you seen if he denies and turns away","transliteration":"Araayta in kaththaba watawalla"},{"id":14,"text":"أَلَمۡ يَعۡلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ne sait-il pas que vraiment Allah voit","translation_en":"Does he not know that Allah sees","transliteration":"Alam yaAAlam bianna Allaha yara"},{"id":15,"text":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمۡ يَنتَهِ لَنَسۡفَعَۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","translation_fr":"Mais non! S'il ne cesse pas, Nous le saisirons certes, par le toupet","translation_en":"No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock","transliteration":"Kalla lain lam yantahi lanasfaAAan bialnnasiyati"},{"id":16,"text":"نَاصِيَةٖ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٖ","translation_fr":"le toupet d'un menteur, d'un pécheur","translation_en":"A lying, sinning forelock","transliteration":"Nasiyatin kathibatin khatiatin"},{"id":17,"text":"فَلۡيَدۡعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","translation_fr":"Qu'il appelle donc son assemblée","translation_en":"Then let him call his associates","transliteration":"FalyadAAu nadiyahu"},{"id":18,"text":"سَنَدۡعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","translation_fr":"Nous appellerons les gardiens [de l'Enfer]","translation_en":"We will call the angels of Hell","transliteration":"SanadAAu alzzabaniyata"},{"id":19,"text":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعۡهُ وَٱسۡجُدۡۤ وَٱقۡتَرِب۩","translation_fr":"Non! Ne lui obéis pas; mais prosterne-toi et rapproche-toi","translation_en":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allah]","transliteration":"Kalla la tutiAAhu waosjud waiqtarib"}]}